{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/bot.png?t=1743279683\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wake up, Pilot. We\u2019ve arrived at Frostpoint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Say hello to your new home\u2014if you can call it that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here, we appreciate a good joke. But your situation? Far from amusing. What remains of you is fragile, but one thing persists\u2014your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Frame is online and ready to harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's dangerous to go alone, and highly inefficient... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your machine is a marvel\u2014capable of leveling cities. You, my friend, will have a more trivial task: move through rough terrain, dig, smash, and collect for your cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gratitude is expected. After all, you are still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/gif_optimised_2.gif?t=1743279683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You have a mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With us, you have nothing but time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time to work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time to think. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time to be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pay your debt and forgiveness is yours. But don't try to be too clever though. No sacrifice will save you this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/gif_optimised_3.gif?t=1743279683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Important features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drama</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forgiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And, if you\u2019re lucky... Perhaps even a glimpse of gameplay \ud83d\ude3c</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By the way, you may call me <strong>Director.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It was nice to meet you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507600?t=1743279683","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743279683","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/1f56c5f9bc5b29f7d6503fc1b88ebd7a650bacb2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743279683","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/1f56c5f9bc5b29f7d6503fc1b88ebd7a650bacb2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743279683","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>The Main Question</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/gif_optimised_1.gif?t=1743279683\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Is This Game for You?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Love mining and having fun? If collecting resources is your favorite hobby in video games, you have found your paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>demo</strong> is coming later this year, and you can be among the first to dive in. Hit that <strong>wishlist</strong> button and stay pawsitive! Se'ya in the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/bot.png?t=1743279683\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wake up, Pilot. We\u2019ve arrived at Frostpoint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Say hello to your new home\u2014if you can call it that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here, we appreciate a good joke. But your situation? Far from amusing. What remains of you is fragile, but one thing persists\u2014your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Frame is online and ready to harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's dangerous to go alone, and highly inefficient... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your machine is a marvel\u2014capable of leveling cities. You, my friend, will have a more trivial task: move through rough terrain, dig, smash, and collect for your cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gratitude is expected. After all, you are still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/gif_optimised_2.gif?t=1743279683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You have a mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With us, you have nothing but time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time to work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time to think. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time to be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pay your debt and forgiveness is yours. But don't try to be too clever though. No sacrifice will save you this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/gif_optimised_3.gif?t=1743279683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Important features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drama</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forgiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And, if you\u2019re lucky... Perhaps even a glimpse of gameplay \ud83d\ude3c</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By the way, you may call me <strong>Director.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It was nice to meet you.</p>","developers":["Dumivid"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/header.jpg?t=1743279683","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098777,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098777/movie480.mp4?t=1739616759","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098777/movie_max.mp4?t=1739616759"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098777/7f278fea069a9ee3b7079da425ef4f6cddbb7e06/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739616759","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098777/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739616759","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098777/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739616759"}}],"name":"Frostpoint Toll","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Dumivid"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q4 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/ddc6f117233f26dc92277f46fbc1107ec1849e83/ss_ddc6f117233f26dc92277f46fbc1107ec1849e83.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743279683","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/ddc6f117233f26dc92277f46fbc1107ec1849e83/ss_ddc6f117233f26dc92277f46fbc1107ec1849e83.600x338.jpg?t=1743279683"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/0abaa8d7b3333b484abf7bb8b23b739d81982cde/ss_0abaa8d7b3333b484abf7bb8b23b739d81982cde.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743279683","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/0abaa8d7b3333b484abf7bb8b23b739d81982cde/ss_0abaa8d7b3333b484abf7bb8b23b739d81982cde.600x338.jpg?t=1743279683"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/21f77cf4c53eec641987b4287dcd69bc5491462a/ss_21f77cf4c53eec641987b4287dcd69bc5491462a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743279683","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.